  "description": "RTX 5080 health on g700data1, from the nvidia_gpu_exporter (job `gpu`, metrics prefixed `nvidia_smi_`). Per-process GPU usage is deliberately absent: this exporter build publishes no `nvidia_smi_process_*` series, so there is nothing to attribute VRAM to a container with. Every panel keys on `uuid` and joins `nvidia_smi_gpu_info` for the card name, so a second GPU appears without an edit.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [
        "dhg"
      ],
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "DHG Dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards"
    }
  ],
  "liveNow": false,
